{"op":"add_node","change_id":"7c26c271-0266-4418-8ccf-763c82ced133","node_type":"decision","title":"Maintain one stock-Deciduous native sync graph as the non-authoritative causal record","description":"Git and GitHub remain authoritative for implementation and project state. Deciduous records consequential reasoning in upstream native event sync only; repository-specific archaeology projections and replay machinery are unnecessary duplication.","status":"pending","metadata_json":null,"timestamp":1786903816331,"author":"bcast"}
{"op":"add_node","change_id":"7006e54e-aa7b-4650-9c01-fdabe5d4c58c","node_type":"action","title":"Use Repository CI Contract v1 as the canonical repository verification gate","description":"Repository verification is discovered through .ci/contract.json and executed through python tools/verify_repository.py so merge state, current tree, tests, schemas, corpus checks, and build checks converge on one repository-owned gate.","status":"pending","metadata_json":null,"timestamp":1786903816339,"author":"bcast"}
{"op":"add_node","change_id":"52da3d6d-4b32-4e99-968f-752249f1d3ca","node_type":"action","title":"Bind derived AST and evidence to explicit publication and source authority state","description":"Derived structures identify their publication and exact retained source evidence while private storage location, access mechanics, and legal authority remain separate. Generated derivatives never replace the authoritative source artifact.","status":"pending","metadata_json":null,"timestamp":1786903816348,"author":"bcast"}
{"op":"add_node","change_id":"d7d80211-cf7c-48f8-9579-084a14427b27","node_type":"action","title":"Preserve unsupported or ambiguous source structure as source-safe diagnostics and recovery evidence","description":"Malformed layout, unresolved references, unsupported regions, raster/OCR recovery, and ambiguous structure remain explicit evidence states. The compiler fails closed instead of silently dropping source material or treating recovery output as native evidence.","status":"pending","metadata_json":null,"timestamp":1786903816357,"author":"bcast"}
